<section class="section" id="what" style="--h: 1; --hm: 2">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>The notch panel</h2>
      <p>One panel for the agent sessions you already run.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fill cards-fill">
      <div class="what-copy">
        <div class="what-item">
          <h3>Session rows</h3>
          <p>Claude Code, Codex and Gemini sessions appear in the notch with their current status.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="what-item">
          <h3>Approval card</h3>
          <p>Permission prompts land in the panel. Approve or deny there; the tool call keeps its real result.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="what-item">
          <h3>Music wing</h3>
          <p>The right wing follows the current track with a progress line and lyrics.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="what-shot">
        <img src="shots/approval.svg" alt="An approval prompt in the Morrow panel with Approve and Deny buttons" width="1200" height="900" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
